  "prefLabel": "Eth 103.07 Attendance at Meetings By Members of the Public",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eth 103.07 Attendance at Meetings By Members of the Public. Pursuant to RSA 91-A:2, II, members of the public may attend and record committee meetings except for those parts of the meetings which are nonpublic sessions pursuant to RSA 91-A:3 and RSA 21-G:31, V.\n\nSource. #12617-A, eff 9-6-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/eth100-200.html"
